       "image": "",
       "attackers": [],
       "reward_exp": 0,
       "description": "<i> She does not agree out loud. She taps the table twice with one finger, the way you tap a wall in the dark to find the door. </i> <br> <br>\n\"The last one I sent asked me why they had not simply killed her. Since you are quicker than him, keep up. The Unsigned chalk a lane before they work it, one stroke, low on the corner stone. Not a warning to you. A note they leave each other.\"",
