       "image": "",
       "attackers": [],
       "reward_exp": 0,
       "description": "<i> She looks up properly for the first time, and does not quite hide that she is reassessing you. </i> <br> <br>\n\"Slowly, then. A body is a crime. Somebody has to investigate a crime, and investigating this one means reading the ledger she was going to talk about. A witness who simply fails to arrive is nobody's case at all. Now, the Unsigned chalk a lane before they work it. One stroke, low on the corner stone. It is not a warning meant for you, it is a note they leave each other.\"",
